# Sako n8n workflows

This folder holds 44 n8n workflows (JSON) and the Google Sheets templates they read and write.

## Layout
- `workflows/<area>/*.json`: one file per workflow. Areas: `leads`, `content`, `pr`, `analytics`, `infra`, `recruiting`, `_shared` (error handler and sub-workflows).
- `templates/*.csv`: the sheet tabs the workflows expect. Import them into one Google Sheet.
- `docs/PUBLISH_ORDER.md`: the order to activate workflows (shared ones first).
- `start.sh`: on first start the container imports every workflow once (`SAKO_IMPORT_WORKFLOWS=true`).

## Rules
- Never commit credentials. Workflows reference n8n credentials by name only; users add their own in n8n.
- The sheet ID is the placeholder `YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID`. Keep it that way in the repo.
- Keep `meta.instanceId` empty.
- No real lead, prospect or customer data in `templates/`: headers and fake rows only.
- When you change a workflow in the n8n editor, export it and replace the JSON file. Keep the file name stable.
- Base image: `n8nio/n8n` 2.x, pinned in `Dockerfile`. Test the import after upgrading.
